{
  "comment": [
    "Oracle checkpoint identities for redsox gate step 1c.",
    "tests/knob_gate/_coverage.py:default_registry_sha256 globs the repo for files",
    "named checkpoint_registry.json and matches artifact_path EXACTLY against the",
    "keys that a vehicle writes into branch_controls.json.",
    "",
    "Those keys are STABLE IDENTIFIERS, not filesystem paths: scripts/parity/",
    "artifact_key.py anchors the path at the vendored upstream repository, so",
    "/home/solab/repos/LASErMPNN/model_weights/x.pt and a clone anywhere else",
    "both key as LASErMPNN/model_weights/x.pt. An absolute path cannot be used",
    "here -- it would make this file correct on exactly one machine.",
    "",
    "A sha256 below is the file's own digest, so changing a checkpoint without",
    "updating this entry fails step 1c rather than silently grading against the",
    "wrong weights."
  ],
